Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:33:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Production offers two versions with its own numbers

PRODUCTION_VERSIONS maps production v1 to staging v4 (the default) and
production v2 to staging v5. Staging still lists v1-v5. Values stay the
staging ids, so only the labels and the dialog text differ.

